      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Creating clear categories helps to map these rhetorical strategies systematically. For the \"Authority/Finality\" profile, look for phrases that end debate, such as \"the reality is...\" or \"it is undeniable that...\" For the \"Compliance/Unity\" profile, look for phrases that mandate collective action, like \"we all agree that\" or \"our shared goal is...\" These categories allow you to systematically track the intentional manipulation of cognitive pathways. Documenting these markers helps create a shared vocabulary to deconstruct such programmed communication.",
